      ],
      "en": "When he went into the house of one of the rulers of the Pharisees on a Sabbath to eat bread, they were watching him.",
      "ko": "안식일에 예수께서 바리새인의 한 두령의 집에 떡 잡수시러 들어가시니 저희가 엿보고 있더라",
      "source_text_hash": "0f435651c6b4c2e06ab2144ae81bacbe79d2c1d2be0771440e64ca84321e7353",
      "translation_text_hash": "56c26a24b302432db233209f7828f2599c7f52ffb168850350ae5ede03370e5e",
