      "en": "But they were silent. He took him, and healed him, and let him go.",
      "ko": "저희가 잠잠하거늘 예수께서 그 사람을 데려다가 고쳐 보내시고",
      "source_text_hash": "d92421856ebaf7fe6e067b945937ba77e6bd11692467b3c2c9b72216ab76ced2",
      "translation_text_hash": "5b754f6c9f4d844dc0d44d3d7380a893b1f043bc99810a9714aabd8b133ad584",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저희가 잠잠하거늘 예수께서 그 사람을 데려다가 고쳐 보내시고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5b754f6c9f4d844dc0d44d3d7380a893b1f043bc99810a9714aabd8b133ad584"
      ]
    },
    {
