      "en": "They couldn’t answer him regarding these things.",
      "ko": "저희가 이에 대하여 대답지 못하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d0e602a0fcff0214c1da0b2c7c36da50fe4411806dad29bc796846ccd5dc3d00",
      "translation_text_hash": "013b6d78f9d0a43dcd93fbd7fad083183b4cfe194a88cf757e831f6e93bb2357",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
